        <mxCell id="c69" value="&lt;i&gt;Credit-positive: revenue reads positive and expenses negative, so the total row, outlined, is each year&#x27;s net income, and the 2026 total equals the card. Other Income or Expense is a revenue subtype in the chart of accounts; its balances are net charges. The matrix is filtered to fiscal 2024 to 2026.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="418" width="860" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
